WEBVTT

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.660
Athena Exclamation.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.770
Shura, Camus, Saga.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:47.150
Aphrodite, Deathmask, Aldebaran.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.070
Shaka.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.620
Not yet. Not until Athena is dead.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.770
I am...

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.590
Shaking Sanctuary

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.640
This is Athena Exclamation.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:18.530
This is the Gold Saint's
ultimate offensive Cosmo.

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:36.510
At this rate, the Virgo house, no,
the Sanctuary will be annihilated.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:40.380
We need to stop this pointless fight.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.340
That's Athena Exclamation.

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:49.440
Is that the flash of two
Athena Exclamations clashing?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:51.840
No way.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:56.390
Did they both unleash the shadow
attack forbidden by Athena?

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:00.660
All of you.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.300
You will obliterate everything.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.320
Athena Exclamation's force...

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.420
...is evenly matched!

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.460
It's miraculously balanced.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.790
It's an awesome force of energy.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:22.200
As is, neither side can let up.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.990
Whichever side slips first will be hit

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:29.140
with the force clashing in between them.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.360
What's this power?

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.750
The balance of forces...

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.110
...Is being disrupted.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.630
Damn it. We're being pushed back.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:12.510
Besides the six of us here,
who else has this much power?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.280
I feel a Cosmo behind Mu and the others.

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:21.100
Hyoga.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:22.820
Shiryu.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:27.300
And Shun. Seiya.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.610
Stop it.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.080
Get out of here.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:36.800
Or else you'll break the balance
of the Athena Exclamations.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:41.620
You'll be pulled into the force and
your bodies will be torn apart.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:43.200
So what?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:49.140
Without the Gold Cloths, your bodies will
not be able to withstand the impact.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.070
Hurry.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.680
Run!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:59.990
We wouldn't have come if
we were going to run away.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.250
Even if our body is torn into pieces.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:08.060
We will fight for the truth!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.530
We're definitely being pushed back.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:17.810
At this rate, we'll be blown
away by Seiya and the others.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.450
But, Seiya...

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.670
You guys won't get away unscathed.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.880
Are you prepared to die?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:30.230
Don't underestimate us,
we are Athena's Saints.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.480
We are always prepared for death.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.330
Shun, Shiryu, Hyoga.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.030
Let's do this!

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.000
What?

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:43.190
You guys?

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.110
What are you planning to do?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.680
Stopping the Athena Exclamation.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.150
What did you say?

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.570
Master Camus.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:53.230
Hyoga.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.380
I know your suffering heart.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.950
Yes, I know you, Master Camus.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:06.240
You would never submit to
Hades for the gift of life.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.800
You are the same, Shura.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:17.100
In my right arm rests Excalibur,
the sacred sword you gave me.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:22.400
I feel your spirit, so I know.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.060
Your conviction.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:28.520
And you all must believe
in your own convictions.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.210
Miro, Mu.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.770
Aioria, why?

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.970
Why are the Gold Saints

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:38.460
with the strongest convictions
fighting each other.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.490
I believe.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:44.180
No, I more than believe.

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:45.390
I...

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.540
We...

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:51.520
Hmm.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:55.750
We are Athena's Saints.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:07:00.850
Athena's Saints fight for love and justice!

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:09.440
That's right. As long as that
feeling burns in our hearts.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:13.220
We can overcome anything.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:18.450
We can even stop the Athena Exclamation!

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:23.140
Our Cosmo will rise to the highest!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:26.540
Nebula Chain!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.960
Diamond Dust!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.780
Rising Dragon!

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:40.690
Pegasus Meteor!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.910
The force of the Athena Exclamation...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.080
...Is climbing to the heavens.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.040
Seiya!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.440
The force of the Athena Exclamation
is climbing to the heavens.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:29.270
Canon? Canon? Is Canon not here?

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:32.030
Yes, I'm here.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:37.480
There's just been a clash in the Virgo house.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.410
It seems it has ended.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.780
Please be assured.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:51.170
Canon, there's something
I want you to bring here.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:51.840
Yes?

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:58.250
Go to the Pope's chambers and bring
me what's underneath the throne.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.590
What's underneath the throne?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.160
It's what Saga left 13 years ago.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:09.740
The time has come to return it to Saga.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.520
Saga, 13 years ago?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.720
Could it be?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.370
Are you two all right?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:25.840
Yes.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:26.910
Somehow.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.240
Where are Seiya and the others?

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.410
I don't see them.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:34.070
Were they crushed as the Virgo house fell?

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:37.910
Seiya, Shiryu, Hyoga, Shun.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.790
You can't die yet.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:46.700
The real battle is about to start.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:55.630
Saga.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.350
You have no manners.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.360
Why haven't you died already?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:07.610
The fight Seiya and the others
risked their lives for.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.330
I must finish you.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:11.890
Die!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:13.710
Wait.

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.080
This voice?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.000
Athena.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:33.570
Miro, Mu, Aioria.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:37.350
You mustn't attack Saga any further.

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:43.220
Bring Saga and the others to me immediately.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:48.830
I cannot do that. They have
come to take your life.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.800
It's fine. I will talk to Saga myself.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:59.660
There's no time. Bring them to me.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.670
Athena.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:10.500
Athena, we've brought Saga and
the others as you ordered.

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.750
They are basically dead.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.990
You won't get anything out of them.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:32.030
Athena.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:38.370
Canon, give the item to Saga.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:38.950
Yes.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.970
Accept it, Saga.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.440
Canon.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.480
What's this?

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.930
Yes, Saga.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.610
Thirteen years ago,

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.070
while I was just an infant,

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.360
you tried to kill me.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.850
With this golden dagger.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.400
Athena.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.450
Why did you bring this out now?

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.010
Look, Aioria.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:38.740
It's all right.

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.450
Mu, you also understand, right?

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.360
Why, now?

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:56.410
For you to kill me, Saga.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.970
Now, no need to hold back.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.460
Stab my throat.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:08.130
Then you will be freed of your suffering.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.620
You don't have to suffer any longer.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:16.510
Athena... You... You!

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:17.410
Saga.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:19.760
No way!

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:29.510
No!

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:34.190
No! Miss Saori, stop it!

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.580
Athena!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.750
Miss Saori. Miss Saori.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.640
Miss Saori. Miss Saori.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:07.010
Miss Saori!

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.370
Miss Pandora.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.160
Rhadamanthys.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.390
Zelos.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:57.020
I'm sorry to disturb you.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:03.050
Your accomplishments are
becoming shinier by day.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:07.520
Disappear. I already know
about Athena's death.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:14.870
Of course, I apologize.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:18.100
We got lucky this time.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:22.940
But luck is also a skill.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:28.800
It seems Athena stabbed herself in the throat

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.620
with the dagger Saga was holding.

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:32.490
What?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.750
Were the Specters sent out without
Miss Pandora's permission unnecessary?

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.970
Did they die with honor?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:48.090
Rhadamanthys, what should
I tell Miss Pandora?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:55.020
Shut up! I am prepared from Pandora's wrath.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.480
You just report to her the truth.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:04.140
I'm more concerned about
Athena taking her own life.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.540
Zelos, I need to see Pandora.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.290
Uh...

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.150
Yes.

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:12.430
My orders are directly from Lord Hades.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:16.280
Whomever disobeys...

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.450
Even The Big Three of the Underworld,

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:23.500
Wyvern Rhadamanthys.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.170
Won't be forgiven.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:29.640
But Athena must not be underestimated.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:35.270
If Athena took her own life,
she must have a motive.

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:37.230
There must be a reason, Miss Pandora.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:41.090
Please consider my reasoning.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:46.960
Shut up. Do you think Lord
Hades will be fooled by Athena?

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:52.440
Your reasoning is what caused

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:59.000
unnecessary Specter deaths.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.580
We still need to kill the remaining Saints

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:07.470
and realize Lord Hades' world domination.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.350
You'll be forgiven this time.

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:15.190
Don't ever do something so reckless again.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.990
Do you understand, Rhadamanthys?

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.830
What are we?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:35.540
As a Saint who is supposed
to protect Athena, I...I...

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:39.600
I couldn't do anything to
prevent Miss Saori's death.

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:41.930
Not a thing.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.020
Seiya.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:48.450
If only...

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.620
If we only had a little
more time and strength...

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.880
Enough. Nothing we say will bring her back.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:01.890
We are useless.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.230
We are only Saints by name.

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:09.010
With this!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.550
This!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.290
What are you crying about?

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.860
Who are you?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.100
Athena is dead.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:29.940
But the real battle is about to begin.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.620
That voice.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:35.990
Shion.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:43.980
He's the former Pope who
pledged himself to Hades.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.950
What about Old Master, Shion?

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.590
So called Saints, move aside.

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:54.610
What did you say?

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:58.610
All you can do is cry.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:02.740
Athena's Saints have fallen.

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.050
You said it!

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:07.900
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:11.180
What?

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:12.890
No way.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:20.640
Is this the extent of your
anger, suffering and sadness?

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.460
How petty.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.350
Seiya!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:29.960
You're the one who's the traitor
Saint. How dare you speak?

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.370
This is for Athena.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:32.270
Here we come!

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:33.340
Damn it.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.630
You won't be forgiven.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:44.450
Wake up, brats!

00:21:56.070 --> 00:21:58.410
Listen carefully.

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:01.930
I'll tell you the meaning of
Athena and Shaka's deaths.

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:04.730
The entire truth.

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:12.210
I, the Pope, will!
